<i>Wow, that's crude.</i>

19:02.530 --> 19:05.490
What if my swimsuit gets washed away?

19:05.920 --> 19:10.850
I'm going to get swarmed by party bros, and...

19:10.850 --> 19:13.710
What's up, girl? You're naked.

19:13.710 --> 19:16.640
They'll take pictures and threaten me, and...

19:16.640 --> 19:19.900
If you don't want this online...

19:22.330 --> 19:25.720
And they'll force me into doing nasty things!

19:25.720 --> 19:27.390
Damn those party bros!

19:27.720 --> 19:29.840
How could you?!

19:29.840 --> 19:31.310
I'm coming!

19:35.010 --> 19:37.480
Shino-san! Are you all right?

19:37.480 --> 19:39.160
Y-Yeah.

19:47.830 --> 19:50.220
<i>I managed to bring him back.</i>

19:50.620 --> 19:53.700
<i>Now I have to make sure he doesn't go anywhere.</i>

19:57.500 --> 20:00.320
Wh-What are you doing?!

20:00.320 --> 20:03.970
M-My leg's cramped! I can't move!

20:03.970 --> 20:05.430
That's bad!

20:05.720 --> 20:08.350
So if my hand slips, I'm sorry!

20:08.350 --> 20:09.810
Stay calm!

20:10.300 --> 20:12.520
I won't let you go!

20:12.520 --> 20:15.730
<b>Thump</b>

20:12.520 --> 20:15.730
<b>Thump</b>

20:12.860 --> 20:15.030
M-Mukai-kun...

20:18.490 --> 20:21.610
It's actually cramped!

20:23.570 --> 20:25.180
Oh, shoot!

20:25.180 --> 20:26.410
I'm sorry!

20:29.490 --> 20:31.340
Good going, Shino!

20:31.340 --> 20:32.730
Hoshizaki-san...

20:32.730 --> 20:34.490
Come on, help me out.

20:42.390 --> 20:45.430
M-Mukai-kun's passed out...

20:45.430 --> 20:47.480
We need to take care of him.

20:52.960 --> 20:55.500
You can lock this room, right?

20:58.100 --> 20:59.570
It's fine.

20:59.570 --> 21:02.530
Okay, I'll have the key, then.

21:03.010 --> 21:04.270
Jeez...

21:04.270 --> 21:07.370
Why am I stuck doing this with you?

21:07.370 --> 21:08.120
What?

21:08.120 --> 21:11.080
You like Naoya, don't you?

21:11.080 --> 21:13.500
S-So what if I do?

21:13.910 --> 21:16.360
Would you have just stood there

21:16.360 --> 21:20.250
and watched as Naoya kissed Saki
if I hadn't told you what to do?

21:21.710 --> 21:23.390
Well...

21:23.390 --> 21:26.470
I'd never stand for that.

21:29.220 --> 21:32.880
I think you're so caught up 
in hiding your own feelings

21:32.880 --> 21:36.690
that you've lost sight of 
something more important.

21:38.470 --> 21:39.520
But...

21:44.690 --> 21:47.410
Meh, not my problem.

21:47.930 --> 21:49.430
Hoshizaki-san...

21:51.320 --> 21:53.270
Now, then...

22:04.260 --> 22:06.300
Naoya's trapped!

22:06.300 --> 22:09.090
What should I do to him?

22:09.090 --> 22:11.050
Hoshizaki-san!

22:17.790 --> 22:21.020
<i>Wh-What is she going to do?</i>

22:21.980 --> 22:26.990
<b>Vacay with the Girlfriends</b>

23:57.570 --> 23:59.660
Next episode preview, but it's on Risapon TV!

23:59.660 --> 24:01.870
Onee-chan and Shino-san are 
going to make a move in episode 10!

24:01.870 --> 24:03.900
I'm finally alone with Naoya!

24:03.900 --> 24:06.010
Don't take it too far or we 
won't be able to go on air.

24:06.010 --> 24:08.940
If that happens, we'll do a 
special stream on Risapon TV!

24:08.940 --> 24:09.920
Really?!

24:09.920 --> 24:11.540
Wait, that's not okay!
